# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Vula Group monorepo — environment template index
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# This file is a *pointer*, not a working .env. Each subproject loads its own
# .env from its own directory. Copy the per-app template you need:
#
#   cp vula_mind/.env.example       vula_mind/.env              # FastAPI backend
#   cp vula_dashboard/.env.example  vula_dashboard/.env.local   # Vite admin UI
#
# vula_mobile/ (Expo) currently reads no secrets — it talks to the backend
# through the public API base URL baked into app.json.
#
# Tenant storefronts (e.g. an Off the Hook Next.js shop) are NOT part of this
# repo — they are deployed independently and call the backend over HTTPS. The
# only values they need from this stack are the backend API_KEY and the Yoco
# public key (see "Shared values" below).
#
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Shared values you'll paste into more than one .env
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Set these once and reuse:
#
#   SUPABASE_URL                  → vula_mind/.env
#   SUPABASE_SERVICE_KEY          → vula_mind/.env (same value as SERVICE_ROLE_KEY)
#   SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY     → vula_mind/.env
#   OPENROUTER_API_KEY            → vula_mind/.env (Railway only — local uses Ollama)
#   YOCO_SECRET_KEY               → vula_mind/.env
#   YOCO_PUBLIC_KEY               → vula_mind/.env  (also used by the storefront
#                                   repo as NEXT_PUBLIC_YOCO_PUBLIC_KEY)
#   YOCO_WEBHOOK_SECRET           → vula_mind/.env
#   PAYFAST_MERCHANT_ID/KEY       → vula_mind/.env
#   WHATSAPP_TOKEN                → vula_mind/.env
#   WHATSAPP_PHONE_ID             → vula_mind/.env (also as WHATSAPP_PHONE_NUMBER_ID)
#   RESEND_API_KEY                → vula_mind/.env
#   API_KEY (backend auth)        → vula_mind/.env
#                                   (storefront repo consumes it as VULA_API_KEY)
#
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Public URLs (safe to commit examples of)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# VULA_BASE_URL=https://app.vula.ai
# VITE_API_URL=https://app.vula.ai
#
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# See DEPLOYMENT.md for end-to-end deploy steps (Railway + Supabase).
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
